# Freemius Developer API — deploy credentials.
#
# Copy this to `.freemius.env` (which is gitignored) and paste your real token.
#   cp .freemius.env.example .freemius.env
#
# The token is the "API Bearer Authorization Token" from
#   Freemius -> your product (EMCP Tools) -> API & Keys.
# It is a SECRET. It lives ONLY in .freemius.env, which is never committed.
# If it ever leaks, click Regenerate in that same Freemius screen.
#
# pro/tools/freemius-deploy.sh auto-loads .freemius.env when present.

FREEMIUS_API_TOKEN=paste-your-bearer-token-here
